--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MiniCommerce V1 through V5 established an enterprise-grade backend architecture:
- 5-Tier Layering (Routers ➔ Services ➔ Repositories ➔ Models ➔ DB/Cache/Workers)
- Pessimistic Row-Level Locking (`SELECT FOR UPDATE` + deterministic ID ordering)
- Transactional Outbox Pattern + ARQ Redis Background Worker Pool + Outbox DLQ
- Redis Cache-Aside Layer (~36x read speedup) + Fast 0.2s Resilient DB Fallback
- Thread-Safe Circuit Breaker State Machine + SHA-256 Payload-Hashed Idempotency
- Dual-Token JWT Rotation (Access JWT + HttpOnly Refresh Cookie) + Redis Blacklist
- Scoped Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) + Keyset Cursor-Based Pagination
- SQL CTEs & Window Functions Revenue Analytics Engine (`RANK() OVER()`, `SUM() OVER()`)
- Store Manager Portal UI + Axios 401 Automatic Refresh Interceptor
